{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2710, "text": "More mail for the foundation."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 5970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4970, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 10130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7710, "text": "That reminds me."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 12930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10590, "text": "Gotta call a plumber and have my toilet\nsnaked."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 19870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17570, "text": "What's the matter, Dan? Your date wear\nyou out last night?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 23490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20470, "text": "No, I was up all night burning the\nmidnight oil in the field foundation."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 26430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23930, "text": "In fact, for the last two nights, I\nhaven't gotten any sleep at all."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 29750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26950, "text": "Well, gee, Dan, if you're working that\nhard, you must be very dedicated."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 33250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30570, "text": "Either that or there's something in it\nfor you. Yeah."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 35650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33890, "text": "Thank you so much."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 39010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36030, "text": "Just when I was about to ask you to be a\nspeaker at the Tri -State Legal"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 42630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39010, "text": "Symposium. Ooh, gee, that's a big deal.\nYou know, last year, three of the"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 43890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42630, "text": "speakers were ex -presidents."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 47930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44190, "text": "The Phil Foundation underwrites their\nspeaking fees. $500 to your favorite"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 50370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47930, "text": "charity. Well, gee, Dan, I'm flattered."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 54450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50630, "text": "I've always thought of the symposium as\nthe one true forum for meaningful legal"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 57330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54450, "text": "dialogue. Actually, we have important\npeople speak about that stuff."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 58950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57790, "text": "You're going to be the comic relief."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 64560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63560, "text": "You mean I do gags?"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 70780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67700, "text": "Well, it wouldn't be the first time. I\nreally killed him at the transit"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 71780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70780, "text": "dinner dance."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 75180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72280, "text": "Yeah, those tunnel cops think you're a\nregular red button."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 80260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76940, "text": "Yeah, Dan, I'd be proud to do it, since\nit's for a good cause. That's a great"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 83180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80260, "text": "cause. That's why I've devoted so much\nselfless energy and time to it."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 85380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84360, "text": "I smell a rat."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 87380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86380, "text": "No, that's the special."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 92300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91280, "text": "Sardine pot pie."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 97610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96610, "text": "Excuse me."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 100830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98430, "text": "Hey, you're Burt Park."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 102110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101110, "text": "That's right."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 104650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102130, "text": "I'm looking for Bull Shannon."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 106210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105110, "text": "Do I know you?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 113230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109170, "text": "Well, it's Burt Parks. You know, Miss\nAmerica."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 115750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114210, "text": "You are Miss America?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 123490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 119670, "text": "Well, we used to host the Miss America\npageants."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 125710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 124710, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 128660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 127660, "text": "I've got a whole new gig now."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 133240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128840, "text": "I'm the spokesman for Frosted Neon\nNuggets Cereal."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 134880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133800, "text": "You are?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 136560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 135260, "text": "Wow, that's impressive."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 144040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138040, "text": "Do you remember entering the Frosted\nNeon Nuggets Little Tykes Golly Georama"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 145120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 144040, "text": "Sweepstakes?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 147600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146440, "text": "I sure do."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 150460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 148260, "text": "Enter number 186949."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 152620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151620, "text": "That's right."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 154700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152960, "text": "You've won the grand prize."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 156440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155440, "text": "Whoa!"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 163200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 157480, "text": "It's a wonderful idea. What is it? It's\nyour choice. Come in, come in, come in."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 168500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 167360, "text": "Let me guess."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 170440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168920, "text": "You're a neon nugget."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 176480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173320, "text": "Hey, you gotta eat. I gotta eat."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 181420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178320, "text": "Mr. Bull Shannon, the choice is yours."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 184540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 181880, "text": "Which prize will it be? Number one?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 187160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185740, "text": "A brand new car."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 194580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188140, "text": "Number two, a summer home in Malibu."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 200280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194580, "text": "Number three, a trip to Paris, France."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 208120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 202120, "text": "Or the mystery prize worth at least\n$200."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 278140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273200, "text": "So did Bo get his rug yet? No, the hair\nmerchant's coming today with the"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 281760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278140, "text": "samples. Well, they're both ready. He's\nout taking combing lessons."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 286920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285920, "text": "Hey, Dan."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 293760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292120, "text": "Hi. You okay, Dan?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 297560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294180, "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah. I just didn't sleep\nagain last night."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 300040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298120, "text": "Hey, man, that's three nights in a row."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 301800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300640, "text": "Maybe it's something wrong."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 304720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302240, "text": "I told you, it was just because of the\nextra work I've been doing on the Phil"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 306340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304720, "text": "Foundation. One of the speakers\ncanceled."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 308500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306600, "text": "Now, I have to give a speech myself."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 310400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 309400, "text": "About what?"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 316240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310500, "text": "Oh, um... No bliss oblige, giving to\nthose who are less fortunate?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 321320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316600, "text": "Uh -huh. It's an address that comes from\nthe heart. Speaks of altruism, charity,"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 322560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321560, "text": "and kindness."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 326860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323040, "text": "Sounds lofty, Dan. But better. I paid\nsome night school geeks 50 bucks to"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 327860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326860, "text": "this one."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 335270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330570, "text": "He who gives is a lucky man, for by\ngiving, he gets to share the joy of the"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 336270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335270, "text": "receiver."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 337870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336670, "text": "What did I get ripped off?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 341070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339970, "text": "Mr. Fielding?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 345690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341670, "text": "Yeah. The name's Hampton from the bank.\nI'm here regarding a check for the Phil"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 349490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345690, "text": "Foundation. Oh, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes,\nyes, yes, yes. Hi. Why don't we just go"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 350550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349490, "text": "in here and talk?"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 352810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351810, "text": "Charity never rests."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 357170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355390, "text": "What the hell are you doing here,\nHampton?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 359130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357550, "text": "There's a problem with this check."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 363040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359600, "text": "It's signed by you as the executor, but\nit's also made out to you."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 365460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364180, "text": "That? Oh, no mistake."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 369840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365780, "text": "I'm filling in as keynote speaker for\nthe symposium. That's my fee. It's all"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 372760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369840, "text": "legal. A $50 ,000 speaking fee?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 375520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374240, "text": "Well, that's the going rate."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 378900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376400, "text": "I tried to get Churchill."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 380100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379100, "text": "He couldn't make it."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 381720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380720, "text": "Churchill's dead."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 384220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382360, "text": "But then he's out for next year, too."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 389320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386080, "text": "Congratulations, Mr. Shannon. Your new\nWimberly wig will not only change your"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 391200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389320, "text": "looks, it will change your life."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 394000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392980, "text": "Yeah, right."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 396640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395540, "text": "You seem cynical."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 399600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397080, "text": "Could you be hiding concerns for your\nown hairline?"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 404220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400520, "text": "Hey, Bob, I got no problems with my\nhair. So why do you wear this hat?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 410840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406640, "text": "Just as I thought. Your hairline is\nrepeating so fast it's leaving skid"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 413700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412700, "text": "Judge Harry."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 417310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 414170, "text": "Listen, if you're gone bald, it's\nnothing to be ashamed of."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 419510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417750, "text": "Of course it is. Watch this."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 421990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420990, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 423710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422150, "text": "Oh, my God, my secret's out!"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 427570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426130, "text": "Well, I think I've made my point."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 429910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427910, "text": "So which one will it be? We have all\nkinds."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 432950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430690, "text": "This is the you -need -to -comb -your\n-hair hair."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 435930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433810, "text": "This is the hey, get a haircut hair."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 439410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436550, "text": "And this is the whoa, you got a bad\nhaircut hair."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 442490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440950, "text": "That's not much of a selection."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 444510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443070, "text": "Sorry, that's all I brought."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 449090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444970, "text": "Yeah, well, it says in the deal that\nBull gets to choose any toupee out of"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 450090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449090, "text": "catalog."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 452310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450930, "text": "Let's see the catalog."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 455870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454870, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 458730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457690, "text": "How about this one?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 461270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459250, "text": "The El Dorado."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 464150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463150, "text": "Too much cyber."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 466730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465730, "text": "How about this one?"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 470050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467730, "text": "The Shatner Turbo 2000."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 478860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475920, "text": "you don't want that one. How about this\none? The shimp."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 485800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480780, "text": "The Shatner Turbo 2000 is cultivated\nfrom the hair of specially selected"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 491740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486180, "text": "And each follicle is individually\nsteamed, pressed, and hand -woven by a"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 492740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491740, "text": "craftsmen in Vienna."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 497100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495680, "text": "I want one."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 502340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499000, "text": "Mr. Shannon, the Shatner Turbo 2000\nisn't for every man."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 504620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502580, "text": "You may not be prepared for its effect."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 508870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505770, "text": "You heard him, Wimberly. He wants the\nhigh -end hair."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 511690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510690, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 512990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511730, "text": "I'll call Vienna tonight."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 515030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513590, "text": "But don't say I didn't warn you."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 518270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517130, "text": "Oh, I can't wait."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 520789, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518929, "text": "I'm gonna go shop for a glass hat."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 527430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524049, "text": "Your Honor, Mr. Skeggs would like to\nplead guilty in exchange for time"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 528730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527730, "text": "Fine with me."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 529830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528830, "text": "Prosecution?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 537880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536880, "text": "I'll have the corned beef."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 547240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544680, "text": "Okay, we'll push the midnight. Let's\ncall it a day, huh?"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 548960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547960, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 552860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549880, "text": "You know, this insomnia of yours is\ngetting serious."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 556060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553420, "text": "Maybe there's some psychological reason\nfor it."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 557940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556260, "text": "Stoic, Sigmund. All I need is sleep."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 559820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558460, "text": "Well, then try warm milk."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 562720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560080, "text": "Or try taking a cold shower and popping\ninto a warm bed."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 567580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563600, "text": "Actually, that brings to mind another\nsurefire sleep aid I'm surprised you"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 568580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567580, "text": "haven't thought of."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 570720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569720, "text": "Way ahead of you."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 576720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573960, "text": "Take two of these, I should be in a coma\nby 1230."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 580420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579240, "text": "Well, Mac. Yeah?"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 584980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580760, "text": "You know, I've been working on my speech\nfor the symposium. Uh -huh. And I was"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 587920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584980, "text": "thinking I might kick it off with a\ncouple of saucy limericks."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 589880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588260, "text": "Oh, I don't know, sir."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 592360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590680, "text": "It's a pretty highbrow audience."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 594050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593050, "text": "Yeah. Yeah."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 597450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594490, "text": "Some of the finest judicial minds in the\ncountry."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 600570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598130, "text": "You're right. Yeah. I'll stick to the\nknock -knock jokes."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 603150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 602150, "text": "You're a pal."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 608130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604610, "text": "If you were really a pal, you'd lock him\nin a trunk until Monday."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 614370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612710, "text": "Darn. There's no salt."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 615770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614770, "text": "Oh, I'll get you some."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 617670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616290, "text": "Excuse me, sir. Can I borrow your salt?"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 619710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618710, "text": "Sure, Christine."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 631570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630570, "text": "I just got it today."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 632890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631890, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 638910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635510, "text": "It makes a big difference."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 641930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640550, "text": "It sure does."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 644050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643050, "text": "I like it."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 647170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644270, "text": "Except ever since I put it on, I've had\nwomen problems."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 656090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655090, "text": "See what I mean?"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 667640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 666640, "text": "It's kind of good looking."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 671600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670600, "text": "Is that?"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 678820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677820, "text": "Oh, my God."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 685980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681440, "text": "For a minute there, I was actually\nturned on by it."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 700840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696460, "text": "There's something you can do. I'm sorry,\nMr. Fielding. I can't find any physical"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 702380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700840, "text": "excuse for your insomnia."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 704760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703760, "text": "Maybe it's psychological."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 707620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705920, "text": "There's nothing wrong with my head."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 713940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708640, "text": "I'm a respected attorney and the\nexecutor of the Phil Foundation, which,"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 717220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713940, "text": "way, I am running in a completely legal\nand honorable manner."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 721800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719460, "text": "Mr. Fielding, is your conscience\nbothering you?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 724420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722780, "text": "What? Of course not."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 729960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727820, "text": "Why would you even ask such a stupid\nquestion?"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 732700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730220, "text": "Well, it's just a theory. Often when\npeople do something they subconsciously"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 735820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732700, "text": "know is wrong, they can't sleep until\nthey rectify their behavior."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 741520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736240, "text": "Yeah, well, great theory, Doc, but\nobviously it doesn't apply in my case"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 746320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741520, "text": "I'm not, no, no, no, no, nothing to be\nashamed of."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 750740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747140, "text": "Doc, listen, I have to give a speech\nthis evening. Can't you just give me a"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 752360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750740, "text": "at something to get me through the next\nfew hours?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 753980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 752620, "text": "It's absolutely out of the question."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 758140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754780, "text": "Keeping yourself awake artificially can\nbe dangerous. And if you don't get some"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 763040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758140, "text": "sleep soon, you're going to become\nincreasingly disoriented, even"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 766200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763160, "text": "and certain vital areas of your body may\nsuffer permanent damage."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 769400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768400, "text": "Which areas?"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 770780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769680, "text": "Your heart and your brain."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 775320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771140, "text": "Thank God for a moment I thought you\nsaid vital."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 782380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780600, "text": "$20. Same as downtown."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 788940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784940, "text": "You know, Matt? What? I only got one\nproblem. What's that? I got too much"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 789940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788940, "text": "stuff."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 794560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790740, "text": "Well, sir, you can always save some of\nit for the encore."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 802780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801200, "text": "Hey, Dad."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 807640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806640, "text": "Dan, are you all right?"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 810820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809180, "text": "You never got any sleep, did you?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 812120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811120, "text": "I'm fine."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 814460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813460, "text": "What's the schedule?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 818390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815050, "text": "I'm on next and then there's dessert and\nthen you deliver the keynote speech."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 819309, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818630, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 820310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 819310, "text": "I'll be there."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 853270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851530, "text": "Don't you have anything smaller?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 858630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857630, "text": "Is this on?"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 862790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861310, "text": "Okay. Okay."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 868210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863430, "text": "Okay. All right. Okay. How many judges\ndoes it take to screw in a light bulb?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 874710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869230, "text": "Two. One to turn it and one to overturn\nit."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 892740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885960, "text": "See, my time is just about up. Thank\nyou. Thank you, Jack Stone. Thank you"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 893740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892740, "text": "very much."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 901200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894620, "text": "We'll break now for dessert and to catch\nour breath and resume with our keynote"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 903580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901200, "text": "speech. Thank you."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 907460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906280, "text": "Tough crowd, Mac."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 908980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907860, "text": "Bad joke, sir."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 914860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911740, "text": "Hey, Dan, you're up next. What's the\nmatter with you?"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 920060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918300, "text": "Get a grip, man."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 921280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920280, "text": "No, you don't understand."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 924760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921680, "text": "He's... Come here."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 930840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929820, "text": "He's not talking."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 934140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933140, "text": "Say what?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 937340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934920, "text": "Must have been one of those momentary\nfigment things."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 942780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941320, "text": "He's not talking, of course."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 944440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943080, "text": "It's just a picture."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 946360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945360, "text": "I'm real."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 951260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949000, "text": "Dan, buddy, you've got to see a doctor.\nI did."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 955060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951780, "text": "He just babbled some nonsense about my\nconscience, and if I didn't sleep soon,"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 956140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955140, "text": "I'd get brain damage."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 957360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956360, "text": "What a quack."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 961080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958720, "text": "Harry, would you mind not breathing fire\non me?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 964499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963600, "text": "What's up?"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 967420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964500, "text": "Well, Dan says Harry's breathing fire on\nhim."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 968900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 967900, "text": "Oh, boy."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 989110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988110, "text": "I showed them."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 991270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990270, "text": "Whoa."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 993370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992030, "text": "What are you staring at?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 996890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993690, "text": "Cut him some slack. His whole family was\nkilled by insects."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1001670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999790, "text": "I'll take him outside so I can get some\nair."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1005070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003890, "text": "Isn't he a dream?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1008810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005790, "text": "Not only is he handsome, but he's\nbrilliant."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1011150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1009970, "text": "H2O equals water."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1014410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013410, "text": "Bull?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1017110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015010, "text": "Get lost, sister. You aren't in his\nleague."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1020920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019920, "text": "See you."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1026180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025140, "text": "Make it fast, Christine."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1028560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026440, "text": "My bevy of babes awaits."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1031700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030400, "text": "Bull, this isn't like you."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1033960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1032160, "text": "You mean this isn't like the old Bull?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1036940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034220, "text": "Well, this is the new Bull. And he's out\nto stud."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1042720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1039700, "text": "Bull, I hope you're not going to let\nthat thing make you vain."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1045020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043260, "text": "You've forgotten you have a girlfriend,\nWanda?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1046920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045380, "text": "These women don't care about you."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1049800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1047420, "text": "You could be the biggest creep in the\nworld, but they'd still want you just"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1050800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049800, "text": "because of the way you look."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1052260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051260, "text": "You think so?"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1053340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052340, "text": "I know so."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1056240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054220, "text": "Wow, I must be even hotter looking than\nI thought."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1064160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059420, "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, due to\nunforeseeable circumstances, Mr."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1067240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064420, "text": "Fielding will not be delivering the\nkeynote address."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1068980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067980, "text": "No! Sorry."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1071120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069280, "text": "I can't do that speech. I want that\nspeech."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1075240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074240, "text": "I'm here."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1080370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079370, "text": "He broke away."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1083430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080610, "text": "He's the first man since high school to\nfind my ticklish spot."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1087310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086310, "text": "Good evening."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1090570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088390, "text": "He who gives is a lucky man."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1093070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091090, "text": "For by giving... Spider!"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1097890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096890, "text": "We've got to do something."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1099310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098310, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1100870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099490, "text": "Let him work this out."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1107930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103690, "text": "For by giving, he gets to share the joy."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1112050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111050, "text": "Share joy."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1116210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114790, "text": "Actually, I once shared a joy."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1124110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123050, "text": "Or was it a joy?"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1132530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125790, "text": "She was... I was... I was... I was\nstrolling through the park"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1133530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132530, "text": "one day."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1145550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140810, "text": "How about the Phil Foundation? It was...\nIt was created to help people..."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1188890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187470, "text": "You gotta tell him the truth."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1189869, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189290, "text": "I did."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1191450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189870, "text": "I did. No, I mean, I did."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1192429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191650, "text": "I did."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1193950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192430, "text": "Tell him. No. No."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1195250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194250, "text": "Tell him!"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1197610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196330, "text": "I lied. I lied. I lied."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1199250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197810, "text": "I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied.\nI lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1199829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199250, "text": "I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1199910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199830, "text": "I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied.\nI lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1200190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199910, "text": "I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied.\nI lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1200849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200190, "text": "I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied.\nI lied. I lied."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1201449, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200850, "text": "I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied.\nI lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1201889, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201450, "text": "I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied. I lied.\nI lied."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1202890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201890, "text": "I lied."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1205530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204490, "text": "I lied."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1209090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208090, "text": "I"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1232159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231280, "text": "I'm sorry, listen."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1238040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232160, "text": "But, you know, I can do this job. I need\nto do this job. I know."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1241440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238880, "text": "That's why I left you in charge of the\nfoundation."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1246300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242380, "text": "But, boss, you gotta try a little\nharder."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1247740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246740, "text": "I will."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1249720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248280, "text": "I will. I will."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1253020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251940, "text": "You forgive me?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1255700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254140, "text": "I forgive you."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1273100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271820, "text": "I'm sure he forgives you, Dan."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1274300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273300, "text": "We all do."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1278340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277340, "text": "He's gone."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1282180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281180, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1286020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1285020, "text": "Let's go home."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1288980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286980, "text": "Okay. You're with friends. You'll be\nfine."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1291220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290220, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1292500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291420, "text": "I know. I'll be fine."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1293980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292980, "text": "I'll be fine."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1296180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295180, "text": "Can I help, Dan?"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1317920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312520, "text": "got some sleep, huh? Like a baby. I had\nfour dreams. I was naked in every one of"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1318920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317920, "text": "them."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1322500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320920, "text": "Nice to have you back, Dan."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1326340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322820, "text": "We were concerned about you after your\nbreakdown yesterday."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1329160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328160, "text": "What breakdown?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1332140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331060, "text": "During your speech."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1336400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332720, "text": "Don't you remember you apologized for\nmisusing the foundation and you begged"}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1337400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336400, "text": "Phil to forgive you?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1340300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338720, "text": "What are you talking about?"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1341940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340940, "text": "Phil's dead."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1346150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343470, "text": "Why would I be begging his forgiveness\nwhen I didn't do anything wrong?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1351330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350250, "text": "Hey, here you go."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1354430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353070, "text": "What the hell am I doing?"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1359430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358430, "text": "Keep it."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1362909, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361930, "text": "Hey, everybody."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1363910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362910, "text": "Oh, hi, Bull."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1366890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364110, "text": "Hey, you couldn't repair that toupee,\nhuh?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1368810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367530, "text": "Oh, Dan didn't hurt it."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1371670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369070, "text": "The Shatner Turbo 2000 is\nindestructible."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1374850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1373770, "text": "Well, then what happened to it?"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1379430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375510, "text": "Well, I thought about what you said,\nChristine, and I realized I've got a"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1380530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1379430, "text": "thing going with Wanda."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1383990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380950, "text": "I didn't want to get all swell -headed\nand ruin the best relationship I ever"}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1385730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1383990, "text": "had. Good for you, Bull."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1390430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1386550, "text": "Yeah, but, Bull, that toupee cost a lot\nof money. You didn't just throw it out."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1393110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1391010, "text": "No, I gave it to a needy friend."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1397130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1394650, "text": "Please, please, girls, girls, one at a\ntime."}
